          "summary": "Checkpoint",
          "description": "Get the latest checkpoint data\nThis endpoint retrieves the latest checkpoint data from the specified table.\nIf no table is specified, it defaults to \"k8s_namespace_recommendations\".\nThe checkpoint data includes the creation time and other relevant fields.",
