          "summary": "VM Recommendations",
          "description": "Get recommendations for VMs\nThis endpoint retrieves recommendations for VMs based on the provided time range.\nIt fetches data from the VMUsageRecommendations table and returns it as a JSON array.\nThe time range is specified by the start_date and end_date query parameters in RFC\n3339 format (e.g., 2023-10-01T00:00:00Z).\nThe recommendations include details such as CPU usage, memory usage, and disk I/O\nfor each VM.",
